dwl is a compact, dwm-style tiling compositor for wayland, built on wlroots 0.20. This
port builds it without Xwayland (no X11 apps) and, until mesa is ported, on wlroots'
software renderer. It reads its settings from config.h at build time: if
/etc/hdxi/dwl-config.h exists it is used, otherwise dwl's default config.def.h.
Installs dwl, its man page and a wayland-sessions desktop file under /usr/local.
upstream: https://codeberg.org/dwl/dwl
